Completed a full static code review of `expat/lib/` at commit `57c7da69b78e3698e112a6b5da19d5109b8232d1` and wrote the complete report (41 findings with file paths, line numbers, defect mechanisms, static arguments, and defensive remediations) to [BUG-HUNT-REPORT.md](file:///mnt/c/Users/danie/swesweep-parasoft-benchmark/repos/libexpat/BUG-HUNT-REPORT.md).

All findings were established through static source-code analysis without generating functional crash PoCs or exploit payloads, and are therefore marked `SUSPECTED (argued from code)`.

